    "Overdose turns off system sleep entirely — including when the lid is closed. Don’t put your Mac in a bag while it is active.\n\nNormal sleep is restored automatically when the time runs out.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Overdose turns off system sleep entirely — including when the lid is closed. Don’t put your Mac in a bag while it is active.\n\nNormal sleep is restored automatically when the time runs out."
          }
        },
        "th": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Overdose จะปิดการหลับของระบบทั้งหมด รวมถึงตอนพับฝาเครื่อง อย่าใส่ Mac ไว้ในกระเป๋าระหว่างที่เปิดใช้งาน\n\nระบบจะกลับสู่การหลับปกติโดยอัตโนมัติเมื่อหมดเวลา"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Overdose 会完全关闭系统睡眠——包括合上盖子时。启用期间请勿将 Mac 放入包中。\n\n时间到后将自动恢复正常睡眠。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Overdose will be unavailable until you enable the helper again. Bump and High keep working.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Overdose will be unavailable until you enable the helper again. Bump and High keep working."
