    "System sleep stays off until you choose Sober — including when the lid is closed.\n\nSafety net: if Meth stops running, macOS sleep is restored within 10 minutes, and always at the next restart.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "System sleep stays off until you choose Sober — including when the lid is closed.\n\nSafety net: if Meth stops running, macOS sleep is restored within 10 minutes, and always at the next restart."
          }
        },
        "th": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "การหลับของระบบจะปิดอยู่จนกว่าคุณจะเลือก Sober รวมถึงตอนพับฝาเครื่อง\n\nระบบป้องกัน: ถ้า Meth หยุดทำงาน การหลับของ macOS จะกลับมาภายใน 10 นาที และกลับมาเสมอเมื่อรีสตาร์ต"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "系统睡眠将保持关闭，直到你选择 Sober——包括合上盖子时。\n\n安全保障：如果 Meth 停止运行，macOS 睡眠将在 10 分钟内恢复，并且下次重启时一定会恢复。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The command line tool is missing from Meth.app. Please reinstall Meth.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The command line tool is missing from Meth.app. Please reinstall Meth."
          }
        },
        "th": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ไม่พบเครื่องมือบรรทัดคำสั่งใน Meth.app กรุณาติดตั้ง Meth ใหม่"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Meth.app 中缺少命令行工具。请重新安装 Meth。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The command line tool was not installed.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The command line tool was not installed."
          }
        },
        "th": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ไม่ได้ติดตั้งเครื่องมือบรรทัดคำสั่ง"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "命令行工具未安装。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The helper could not be installed.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The helper could not be installed."
          }
        },
        "th": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ติดตั้งตัวช่วยไม่สำเร็จ"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法安装助手。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The helper could not be removed.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The helper could not be removed."
          }
        },
        "th": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ลบตัวช่วยไม่สำเร็จ"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法移除助手。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This Mac does not support disabling system sleep, so Overdose is unavailable.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This Mac does not support disabling system sleep, so Overdose is unavailable."
          }
        },
        "th": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mac เครื่องนี้ไม่รองรับการปิดการหลับของระบบ จึงใช้ Overdose ไม่ได้"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此 Mac 不支持禁用系统睡眠，因此无法使用 Overdose。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "To disable system sleep, Meth installs a small privileged helper. It can only turn macOS’s “disablesleep” setting on and back to its original value, and it restores sleep on its own when your time runs out — even if Meth quits.\n\nmacOS will ask you to allow Meth in System Settings › General › Login Items.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "To disable system sleep, Meth installs a small privileged helper. It can only turn macOS’s “disablesleep” setting on and back to its original value, and it restores sleep on its own when your time runs out — even if Meth quits.\n\nmacOS will ask you to allow Meth in System Settings › General › Login Items."
          }
        },
        "th": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "เพื่อปิดการหลับของระบบ Meth จะติดตั้งตัวช่วยขนาดเล็กที่มีสิทธิ์ผู้ดูแลระบบ ตัวช่วยนี้ทำได้เพียงเปิดการตั้งค่า “disablesleep” ของ macOS และคืนค่าเดิมเท่านั้น และจะคืนค่าการหลับเองเมื่อหมดเวลา แม้ว่า Meth จะปิดไปแล้วก็ตาม\n\nmacOS จะขอให้คุณอนุญาต Meth ใน การตั้งค่าระบบ › ทั่วไป › รายการล็อกอิน"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "为了禁用系统睡眠，Meth 会安装一个小型特权助手。它只能开启 macOS 的“disablesleep”设置并将其恢复为原始值；时间到后，即使 Meth 已退出，它也会自行恢复睡眠。\n\nmacOS 会要求你在“系统设置 › 通用 › 登录项”中允许 Meth。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Try it: meth status": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Try it: meth status"
          }
        },
        "th": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ลองพิมพ์: meth status"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "试试：meth status"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Turn on Meth under “Allow in the Background” in System Settings › General › Login Items, then choose Overdose again.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Turn on Meth under “Allow in the Background” in System Settings › General › Login Items, then choose Overdose again."
          }
        },
        "th": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "เปิด Meth ในหัวข้อ “อนุญาตให้ทำงานเบื้องหลัง” ที่ การตั้งค่าระบบ › ทั่วไป › รายการล็อกอิน แล้วเลือก Overdose อีกครั้ง"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "请在“系统设置 › 通用 › 登录项”的“允许在后台”中打开 Meth，然后再次选择 Overdose。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your current session keeps running.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your current session keeps running."
          }
        },
        "th": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "เซสชันปัจจุบันจะยังทำงานต่อ"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "当前会话会继续运行。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "macOS refused the power assertion.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "macOS refused the power assertion."
          }
